  "steps": [
    "Mix the chicken with its marinade ingredients. In a small bowl, mix the hot water, sugar, soy sauces, salt and white pepper for the sauce.",
    "Fluff the rice, breaking up any clumps.",
    "Heat a wok over medium-high heat with 1 tbsp oil. Scramble the eggs until just set and remove.",
    "Heat the wok until just smoking, add 1 tbsp oil and sear the chicken in one layer for about 20 seconds, then stir-fry until about 80% cooked. Remove.",
    "Add the last tbsp oil and sauté the onion until translucent. Add the rice, flatten it and break up clumps; stir-fry until hot (about 5 minutes if cold). Keep it from getting wet.",
    "Add the sauce and toss to coat. Return the chicken and its juices and stir-fry 1 minute.",
    "Add the eggs, bean sprouts and scallion and stir-fry 30 seconds. Push the rice to the centre, wait 20 seconds, drizzle the Shaoxing wine around the edge, stir-fry 20 seconds and serve."
